This product is built against fgb_module_api.h from FaceGaze Bridge
(https://github.com/Aqamoe/FaceGaze-Bridge), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The SDK headers are resolved at build time from the
release pinned in sdk.lock.json; this repository does not contain a copy of
them.

The tail-packet layout (last 244 bytes as 61 big-endian float32), the field
order (Constants.LiveLinkNames) and the expression/eye mapping were informed
by the VRCFT module LiveLinkTrackingModule
(https://github.com/VRCFaceTracking/LiveLinkTrackingModule). That repository
does not declare a license; this repository is an independent C++
implementation of the same wire format and contains none of its source code.

